      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Read straight from durare's tables in Postgres, the record atomic recovers from. This works without any telemetry export. Statuses: PENDING (running, waiting or interrupted), ENQUEUED, DELAYED (scheduled for later), SUCCESS, ERROR, CANCELLED and MAX_RECOVERY_ATTEMPTS_EXCEEDED. Until atomic has created these tables in this database, the panels report that the relation does not exist."
      },
